    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d509">

                <pb facs="0993" n="981" sameAs="frus:frus1946v09/pg981"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Marshall Mission Files, Lot 54–D270</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by General Marshall to Generalissimo Chiang
                        Kai-shek</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">OSE 124</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-06-05">June 5, 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Your Excellency</hi>: Following my conference with
                    General Chou En-lai this afternoon, I set noon, tomorrow, June 6th as the time
                    of commencement of the 15–day period.</p>
                <p>Attached is a proposed press release which I am submitting to General Hsu and
                    General Chou. I hope you approve.</p>
                <p>With great respect,</p>
                <p>Faithfully yours,</p>
                <closer>[<signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">George</hi> C. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi></signed>]</closer>


                <xi:include href="d509-a1.xml" xpointer="d509-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
